{"id":"jeronima-perez","name":"Jerónima Pérez Luelmo","givenNames":"Jerónima","surnames":["Pérez","Luelmo"],"birth":{"date":"1745-11-02","place":"Morales del Vino"},"baptism":{"date":"1745-11-10"},"marriages":[{"spouse":"vicente-martin","date":"1765-04-24","place":"Morales del Vino"}],"death":{"date":"1769-05-19","place":"Morales del Vino"},"mother":"atilana-de-luelmo","father":"manuel-perez-carrascal","burial":{"date":"1769-05-20","place":"Morales del Vino","transcription":"María Gerónima Pérez.\n\nEn veinte de Mayo de mil settos y sesenta y nueve as se enterró en esta Yglesia María Gerónima Pérez muger que fue de Bizente Martín. Murió el día diez y nueve de dicho mes, rezivió todos los Stos Sacramentos, no hizo testamento. Hízosele entierro, onrras y cabo de año y novenario cantado y su marido hizo por su alma todo lo acostumbrado. Dejó un hijo y para que conste lo firmé. Dn Antto Cabrero."},"parentSummaries":[{"id":"manuel-perez-carrascal","name":"Manuel Pérez Carrascal","givenNames":"Manuel","surnames":["Pérez","Carrascal"],"relation":"father"},{"id":"atilana-de-luelmo","name":"Atilana Luelmo Arroyo","givenNames":"Atilana","surnames":["Luelmo","Arroyo"],"relation":"mother"}],"children":[{"id":"francisca-martin-perez","name":"Francisca Martín Pérez","givenNames":"Francisca","surnames":["Martín","Pérez"],"father":"vicente-martin","mother":"jeronima-perez"}],"partners":[{"id":"vicente-martin","name":"Vicente Martín Martín","givenNames":"Vicente","surnames":["Martín","Martín"],"sharedChildren":["francisca-martin-perez"]}]}
